  "name": "tanfust",
  "title": "Tanfust",
  "author": "Tanfust <https://tanfust.com>",
  "description": "The Tanfust design system as one install: an ink-on-paper warm neutral palette (oklch hue 70-85), square corners, the named type scale, Geist Sans for text, Geist Mono for labels, inverted bold menus, and the @tanfust registry pre-registered in components.json. Works with Radix or Base UI — it does not pin a primitive library.",
